Z||000000||FieroKyle||08-08-2001||12:15 AM||||Hey, what was the engine used to power the real pace cars cuz that iron duke by its self isn't fast enough to pace indy cars with out mods. Also did the Fiero just pace the Indy cars for one year?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever2||08-08-2001||12:28 AM||||This will make for some interesting reading: <A HREF="http://www.users.qwest.net/~racing2win/Fiero_Fun.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.users.qwest.net/~racing2win/Fiero_Fun.htm</A> <P>The Super Duty (SD4) was the engine in the pace cars.<P>Oh, and one year only, yes.  I have the official Program if you want to buy it.<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 08-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroMaster88||08-08-2001||12:31 AM||||Official program???  How much?  My dad loves indy racing and it would make him a good birthday gift! LMK.<P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||1
